            "text": "Created attachment 3934\ncacheMetadata and ..checkRequiredGenerics handle duplicates correctly\n\nMade one tweak to change `length(.) > 1L` to `anyDuplicated(.)` which is (1) a little clearer and (2) skips the more accurate `duplicated(paste(...))` allocation on the \"happy path\" where there are no duplicates generics to further disambiguate with `package`.\n\nI also put this on the GitHub mirror: https://github.com/r-devel/r-svn/pull/391",
